description=ColorOS 17 (IN/global): enables stock ColorOS Contacts + Phone (InCallUI) + Messages, optionally disables Google Dialer + Messages, translates the Calendar's Hindi India holidays to English. ColorOS (global) Calendar is a separate APK on the release page.
